{
 "batchId": "b-0525",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_448aafd35f18ba015eab",
   "sourceHash": "448aafd35f18ba015eabbee81566375c00dcd30321b6103561c564ae56bcc5a8",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村将环境保护、文化传承与社区发展融为一体，成为植根于阿育吠陀原则的可持续健康模式的典范。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0b433150ab87ebbc5553",
   "sourceHash": "0b433150ab87ebbc5553ed9132b496a50b1a8af24feff1848dc0e6695c407d5c",
   "text": "首页 – 社会、文化与环境承诺",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_97057f1d3999c597b6b7",
   "sourceHash": "97057f1d3999c597b6b763188a9a9ef3395d8614787599934390f09484ede685",
   "text": "社会责任 | 保护自然 | 阿育吠陀村 | 治疗项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_18a757f0a9b726fbf5e9",
   "sourceHash": "18a757f0a9b726fbf5e963759945d278a0ee47926ae3426b03ab83db15656b76",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Group 的企业社会责任项目，支持其阿育吠陀医院的可持续发展，并为印度喀拉拉邦当地社区提供优质支持。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dcc523e3683415fcb70f",
   "sourceHash": "dcc523e3683415fcb70ff556e4489aaf1d64408b16379da7e41f13e51ec13022",
   "text": "当今的企业若希望长久发展，就必须以社会认可的方式开展经营活动。企业的经营不应危及子孙后代的命运，为此，企业需要为社会、环境和客户着想。Kairali Ayurvedic Group 秉持商业道德持续经营，在推动经济发展的同时，提升员工及其家人的生活质量。我们的行动始终以惠及当地社区乃至整个社会为考量。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dbe32c797861d67926d4",
   "sourceHash": "dbe32c797861d67926d4cf20adaf7ccba5ed2964e5ec0da12a456fc09183dab6",
   "text": "一个组织的成功发展，不能仅以不断增长的利润来衡量，而在于社会的认可与赞誉。喀拉拉邦被誉为“阿育吠陀的天堂”，是 Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村的所在地。若没有喀拉拉邦赋予我们的古老知识与智慧，就不会有我们今天的成功。因此，我们有责任以关爱这片土地的社会、文化和环境的方式予以回馈。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_16d9cc32341874a9e5b6",
   "sourceHash": "16d9cc32341874a9e5b656d69a4f3c8a4b1f0cbea898218e4bca40bac764e7d1",
   "text": "本地社区外展",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ed19704f553b17b812b3",
   "sourceHash": "ed19704f553b17b812b3b97c52855b74f3f14d9b549f8d498ab90cd750cdae77",
   "text": "我们的慈善外展项目满足了周边民众多方面的基本需求",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4f0378b92509b06f91c1",
   "sourceHash": "4f0378b92509b06f91c1421103cf7145268cddb66dd774d65992237bbd9aee50",
   "text": "提供耕地：当地一些农民陷入财务危机和经济困难，没有自己的土地可耕种，难以养家糊口，Kairali Ayurvedic Group 为他们提供农业用地。剩余的粮食由 Kairali 收购或出售给当地合作社。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1dc74f8eff6a3442cf23",
   "sourceHash": "1dc74f8eff6a3442cf233f62b329e6ff384e7c989f473070dc18bf51108fd481",
   "text": "按 MSP（最低支持价格）回购：对于在我们土地上获得耕地的农民，我们设有按 MSP 回购其粮食的流程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_174d4d4e2757b467b184",
   "sourceHash": "174d4d4e2757b467b184b279fb7d37073741362b589fb9647c2d45e1d9bc239f",
   "text": "我们与“Hope”基金会携手，致力于通过培训提升当地成年人（尤其是女性）的技能，帮助她们实现经济独立。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d87280d58e36ceea14ee",
   "sourceHash": "d87280d58e36ceea14eecf9a59be7c708e05e921bd8ba987fc7208a13ecba049",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Group 向帕拉卡德周边的当地社区捐款。我们还向 Chitoor 村的当地医院提供资金支持、病床和设备，并将在未来继续这项工作。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_504f12488bd583bc2df7",
   "sourceHash": "504f12488bd583bc2df71bae722793119bd9bd77106609bf058a522ed6eec5ac",
   "text": "我们向 Kodumbu 村的当地学校捐赠了电脑、桌子、椅子、柜子以及购书款。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d3313c6d80ede104a21c",
   "sourceHash": "d3313c6d80ede104a21cd8b05236a20ac2b8a663774a9807cc2dcd77643e689a",
   "text": "我们已为近 5000 名经济困难人士提供免费体检，并提供免费健康咨询，以及在 Kairali 院内住宿 2 晚。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source is ambiguous about whether the 2-night stay is also free; kept ambiguous (not stated as free). Please confirm."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
